// ESXi Network Configuration Discovery Via ESXCLI | T1007, T1033, T1059.012 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_esxcli_network_discovery.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where ends_with(Image, "/esxcli") and CommandLine like "*network*" and (CommandLine like "* get*" or CommandLine like "* list*")
